+    // -----------------------------------------------------------------------
+    // Ctrl+D / EOF abort tests
+    //
+    // When the user presses Ctrl+D during an interactive prompt, the
+    // program must NOT panic or hang. Instead it should return
+    // `BivvyError::PromptAborted` to signal graceful cancellation.
